      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "There was me, that is Alex, and my three droogs, that is Pete, Georgie and Dim and we sat in the Korova milkbar trying to make up our rassoodocks what to do with the evening."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 648,
        "text": "As the music came to ist climax, I could viddy myself very clear, running and running on like very light and mysterious feet, carving the whole face of the creeching world with my cut throat britva. I was cured all right."
      }
